      "source_location": null,
      "source_url": null,
      "captured_at": null,
      "author": null,
      "contributor": null,
      "rationale": "Allowlist reveals the day-to-day operator toolchain for this repo: talosctl against nodes 192.168.15.7-.9 with clusters/feather-core/generated/talosconfig, kubectl (rook-ceph / rook-ceph-fr01 namespaces), flux reconcile/suspend/resume, sops encrypt/updatekeys with PGP fingerprint 0231831CB40B8E587B7353CBA3AF727721205A62, and gh api/search for upstream issue research."
    },
    {
      "id": "workflows_flux_validate_validate",
      "label": "flux-validate CI job (kustomize build + kubeconform)",
      "file_type": "code",
      "source_file": ".claude/worktrees/agent-a3ff106175eed2f7a/.github/workflows/flux-validate.yaml",
      "source_location": null,
      "source_url": null,
      "captured_at": null,
      "author": null,
      "contributor": null,
      "rationale": "Renders every Flux Kustomization and schema-checks the output so broken manifests never reach the cluster; triggered on PRs touching clusters/**, infrastructure/**, apps/**, helm/**, scripts/validate.sh and on pushes to main."
    },
    {
